                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "You could have a great doctor and a solid treatment plan, and catch the disease at its very first symptom, and still have medical complications because an insurance company denied the prior authorization claim. Read more in my oped at @WashTimes here:",
