                "source": "Hootsuite Inc.",
                "text": "Giving insurance companies the power to override the medical judgment of doctors is wrong. These administrative roadblocks cost Americans their health and their lives. That\u2019s why I reintroduced the Reducing Medically Unnecessary Delays in Care Act. \n\nhttps://t.co/zkCMWwtZ3n",
