                "text": "It shouldn\u2019t take decades to determine a link between toxic exposure during military service and diseases like cancer. We now know military leaders were supposed to communicate with K2 servicemembers about health risks, but many claim no briefings ever took place. \n\nMore in @clarksvillenow:\n\nhttps://t.co/hZNBPvbmu2",
