                "text": "As a physician and survivor of thyroid and colon cancer, my Reducing Medically Unnecessary Delays in Care Act of 2025 serves as a solution to bust through the red tape that often puts health insurance bureaucrats between patients and their doctors. More in my op-ed in @WashTimes:\n\nhttps://t.co/1rdg7hJ1bL",
