                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "There were repeated warnings at Camp Stronghold Freedom that servicemembers were being exposed to toxins, and yet their health and safety were ignored by the Pentagon leadership of that day. That\u2019s why I sent a letter urging the DOD to complete a study on the toxic exposure of K2 veterans during the War on Terror as mandated by the FY2021 NDAA after the Biden administration neglected to do so for four years.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZYjnpaeqPD",
