                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Under my bill, restrictions must be based on medical necessity and written clinical criteria. This also applies to prescription drug care. Ultimately, my bill requires that board-certified physicians in the same specialty have the final say on the health of their patients.\n\nhttps://t.co/Qz5FNhL1yT",
